<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury sale raises 395.25 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury sale raises 395.25 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 395.25 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Rates and amounts (in million dirhams) were accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	 BID    AMOUNT		INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    26 weeks	 20	20			8.35 pct</p>
<p>    Two years	 4	 4			9.50 pct</p>
<p>    Five years    155.25  155.25		  10.00 pct</p>
<p>    10 years	180     180		     10.25 pct</p>
<p>    15 years	 36	36		     10.50 pct</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	   395.25  395.25</p>
<p>($1= 8.9 dirhams)</p>
<p>-- Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518</p>
</text>
